# Audit artifacts produced when these skills run inside a target repository.
#
# These are embargoed by default: they contain unpatched vulnerability details,
# PoC exploit tests, ISSUE.md impact write-ups and auditor scorecards. Phase 5 of
# aggregating-audit-campaigns publishes findings to a public GitHub repository,
# so the local copy should not be committed by accident before that step is
# deliberately run. Ignore it here and remove the rule if you intend to commit
# findings under embargo.
test/audit_review/
audit_review/

